problems.problem:
The sides of a triangle are $a$, $b$ and $c$. Express in terms of them the side $x$ of the square whose area equals the area of this triangle. Construct:
1) the given triangle (from $a$, $b$ and $c$);
2) the side $x$ of the square (on the basis of the expression obtained);
3) the required square (from its side $x$).

problems.problem_orig:
Kolmnurga küljed on $a$, $b$ ja $c$. Avaldada nende kaudu selle kolmnurgaga pindvõrdse ruudu külg $x$. Konstrueerida:
1) antud kolmnurk ($a$, $b$ ja $c$ kaudu);
2) ruudu külg $x$ (saadud avaldise põhjal);
3) otsitav ruut (külje $x$ abil).
